,"then":[{"c":"msg","face":"haru","name":"Haru","text":"Mio? Mio Ashiro! It\u2019s me, Haru. We shared a desk at the temple school, remember? You always drew lanterns in the margins."},{"c":"msg","face":"haru","name":"Haru","text":"Granny Sachi used to send us out here to cut reeds for the festival. Now the reed field\u2019s grown into a hedge maze. Spirits wander it at night."},{"c":"msg","face":"haru","name":"Haru","text":"If you\u2019re going in, take these. You used to trade me your rice balls for my ink. Call it even."},{"c":"item","id":"rice_ball","n":2,"quiet":false},{"c":"set","sw":"maze_haru","v":true}],"else":[{"c":"msg","face":"haru","name":"Haru","text":"Go on, Mio. The reeds remember you, even if they\u2019ve grown taller."}]}]}]},{"id":9,"x":19,"y":25,"realm":"near","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":{"sheet":"woman","dir":"down","step":false},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"if","cond":{"nsw":"maze_nao"},"then":[{"c":"msg","face":"woman","name":"Teacher Nao","text":"Well, if it isn\u2019t my most daydreaming pupil. You still stand like you\u2019re listening for something only you can hear."},{"c":"msg","face":"woman","name":"Teacher Nao","text":"Sachi told me once that keepers are taught twice: once by people, once by the road. This maze is the road\u2019s lesson. Patience. Every dead end teaches the turn you missed."},{"c":"set","sw":"maze_nao","v":true}],"else":[{"c":"msg","face":"woman","name":"Teacher Nao","text":"Sachi told me once that keepers are taught twice: once by people, once by the road. This maze is the road\u2019s lesson. Patience. Every dead end teaches the turn you missed."}]}]}]},{"id":10,"x":11,"y":3,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":{"sheet":"tokubei_far","dir":"down","step":false},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"if","cond":{"nsw":"maze_tokubei"},"then":[{"c":"msg","face":"tokubei_far","name":"Old Tokubei","text":"Ah\u2026 the little one who waited by my cart every day after lessons. You and Haru, sticky fingers, one mochi between you."},{"c":"msg","face":"tokubei_far","name":"Old Tokubei","text":"I sold sweets on the reed road for forty years. I don\u2019t remember when I stopped. But I remember you."},{"c":"msg","face":"tokubei_far","name":"Old Tokubei","text":"Lamp oil, from the bottom of my cart. A keeper should never walk with a hungry flame."},{"c":"item","id":"lantern_oil","n":2,"quiet":false},{"c":"set","sw":"maze_tokubei","v":true}],"else":[{"c":"msg","face":"tokubei_far","name":"Old Tokubei","text":"Go on, Mio. The reeds remember you, even if they\u2019ve grown taller."}]}]}],"peek":false},{"id":11,"x":6,"y":23,"realm":"near","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":{"sheet":"villager4","dir":"down","step":false},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"if","cond":{"nsw":"maze_suzu"},"then":[{"c":"msg","face":"villager4","name":"Suzu","text":"You made it through! I got lost three times. Haru said you\u2019d never need a map, since you used to win at hide-and-seek in these reeds."},{"c":"msg","face":"villager4","name":"Suzu","text":"Remember when we hid here till dark and Granny Sachi found us with one lantern and no scolding at all? I think about that every Lantern Night."},{"c":"msg","face":"villager4","name":"Suzu","text":"Herbal tea from my mother\u2019s shop. And there\u2019s a supply box by the exit. Someone left it there for travellers."},{"c":"item","id":"herbal_tea","n":2,"quiet":false},{"c":"set","sw":"maze_suzu","v":true}],"else":[{"c":"msg","face":"villager4","name":"Suzu","text":"Go on, Mio. The reeds remember you, even if they\u2019ve grown taller."}]}]}]},{"id":12,"x":27,"y":2,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"maze_intro"},"g":null,"trigger":"touch","list":[{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"The old reed field\u2026 it\u2019s grown into a maze. Granny used to say a keeper learns the way by losing it first."},{"c":"set","sw":"maze_intro","v":true}],"through":true}]}],"lights":[{"x":27,"y":2,"r":4},{"x":3,"y":22,"r":4},{"x":11,"y":3,"r":1.1,"realm":"far","a":0.3,"tint":12115173}],"encounter":{"region":3,"zone":"z01m"},"counters":[],"noShift":false,"dyn":[],"bg":null}